    "video_id": "CuVr8-zw84A"
   }
  ],
  "1": [
   {
    "context": "And how God had to like sort of train the early church about how open the gospel message was. Sometimes he has to train us about how open God's love and his message of grace is for everyone. Because we can sometimes get a little, you know, like we don't, I don't need to worry about that person over there. God can save them, really, are you sure?",
