    "video_id": "o4xwzInRySA"
   },
   {
    "context": "And I said, listen, we've got to come to terms with understanding who we are. Either we're saved or we're not saved. We're we're we're holy or we're not holy. We're this or that. And what I was trying to say was, hey, as far as grace is concerned, if you're saved, then nothing else matters. If you mess up, you mess up. Just come to terms with the fact that you're either saved or you're not. If you are great, just let everything else go. You don't gotta do, you don't got to jump through hoops. You don't gotta do all this praying, you don't got to do all this fasting, you don't got to do all this Bible study, you don't gotta come to church.",
